# expo prebuild + gradle output. Gitignored, so CI checkouts never have it —
# but a local `docker build` ships it to the daemon and bakes it into the
# builder layer via `COPY apps/ apps/`. Measured at 4.1 GB on a machine that
# has run ./dev.sh --mobile-android.
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios

# docker-compose.prod.yml and Caddyfile are deliberately NOT listed here: the
# Dockerfile bakes them into /opt/release/ so deploy.sh can adopt the pair
# each image was built with (see ops/README.md). Neither holds a secret
# value; both only reference .env keys and files under /srv/haalkhata/secrets.
.github
